      "description": "The content layer's own ContentAdapters: `document/`. Its imports into `cat-harness-tools/src/`, `cat-harness/schemas/` and `cat-harness-tools/pipeline/` are DOWNWARD and therefore legal (core declares `needs: [\"cat-harness\"]`); nothing in the harness imports it. Its consuming tests live in `scripts/tests/`. It needs `tsconfig.json`'s `include` entry (without it `bun run typecheck` passes while covering fewer files) and the `BUILTIN_ADAPTERS` module path, which is resolved by variable specifier, so no static-import gate checks it. `paper/` is the science layer's, in that layer's own `adapters/paper/`.",
